🎉 Calculator Plus v3.1.2 is here!

🎨 A whole new look — Material You design throughout, with rounded keys, a fresh splash screen and redesigned Settings and About pages
🌈 Colours from your wallpaper — on Android 12 and up the app can match your system theme, alongside the accent colours you already had
📳 Haptic feedback — optional vibration on every key press, switch it on in Settings
👀 Live results — watch your answer update as you type, now working on far more phones
📐 Landscape that fits — the keypad is no longer cut off, with a layout built for wide screens
🛠️ Fixed a crash that could stop the app opening, plus speed and consistency improvements across screen sizes
